---
// The headline made visible: money in, held, split three ways.
// Ribbon heights are proportional to the amounts, so the drawing cannot lie.
// 850 + 120 + 30 = 1000. Figures approved 2026-10-27 as representative,
// not taken from a specific client.
const splits = [
	{ amount: '850 lei', role: 'Vânzător', pct: 85, tone: 'teal' },
	{ amount: '120 lei', role: 'Comision platformă', pct: 12, tone: 'mint' },
	{ amount: '30 lei', role: 'Procesare', pct: 3, tone: 'dim' },
];
---

<figure class="m-0">
	<figcaption class="sr-only">
		O plată de 1.000 de lei e reținută de platformă până la confirmare și se împarte în 850 de lei către vânzător, 120 de lei
		comision de platformă și 30 de lei costuri de procesare.
	</figcaption>

	<!-- Desktop: ribbons at true proportion. -->
	<svg
		viewBox="-120 15 680 370"
		class="hidden h-auto w-full lg:block"
		role="presentation"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
		<!-- incoming -->
		<rect x="96" y="60" width="144" height="240" class="fill-paper/12" />

		<!-- held by the platform -->
		<rect x="240" y="60" width="56" height="240" class="fill-ink-800 stroke-teal" stroke-width="1.5"
		></rect>
		<text
			x="268"
			y="180"
			transform="rotate(-90 268 180)"
			text-anchor="middle"
			class="fill-teal font-mono text-[15px] tracking-[0.22em]">REȚINUT</text
		>

		<!-- outgoing, height proportional to the amount -->
		<path d="M296,60 C368,60 368,30 440,30 L440,234 C368,234 368,264 296,264 Z" class="fill-teal" />
		<path
			d="M296,264 C368,264 368,270 440,270 L440,298.8 C368,298.8 368,292.8 296,292.8 Z"
			class="fill-mint"
		></path>
		<path
			d="M296,292.8 C368,292.8 368,350 440,350 L440,357.2 C368,357.2 368,300 296,300 Z"
			class="fill-paper/35"
		></path>

		<!-- labels -->
		<text x="88" y="150" text-anchor="end" class="fill-paper/50 font-mono text-[15px] tracking-[0.18em]"
			>INTRĂ</text
		>
		<text x="88" y="186" text-anchor="end" class="fill-paper font-mono text-[30px]">1.000 lei</text>

		<text x="458" y="126" class="fill-teal font-mono text-[28px]">850 lei</text>
		<text x="458" y="152" class="fill-paper/55 font-mono text-[15px] tracking-[0.18em]">VÂNZĂTOR</text>

		<text x="458" y="278" class="fill-mint font-mono text-[22px]">120 lei</text>
		<text x="458" y="302" class="fill-paper/55 font-mono text-[15px] tracking-[0.18em]">COMISION</text>

		<text x="458" y="350" class="fill-paper/70 font-mono text-[18px]">30 lei</text>
		<text x="458" y="374" class="fill-paper/55 font-mono text-[15px] tracking-[0.18em]">PROCESARE</text>
	</svg>

	<!-- Under 1024px: same data, stacked, because ribbon labels stop being legible. -->
	<div class="lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-paper/50">INTRĂ</span>
			<span class="font-mono text-2xl">1.000 lei</span>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-4 border border-teal/50 bg-ink-800 px-4 py-2.5 text-center">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.22em] text-teal">REȚINUT</span>
		</div>

		<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4">
			{
				splits.map((s) => (
					<li>
						<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-paper/55">
								{s.role.toUpperCase()}
							</span>
							<span
								class:list={[
									'font-mono text-lg',
									s.tone === 'teal' ? 'text-teal' : s.tone === 'mint' ? 'text-mint' : 'text-paper/70',
								]}
							>
								{s.amount}
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="mt-2 h-2 bg-paper/8">
							<div
								class:list={[
									'h-full min-w-[3px]',
									s.tone === 'teal' ? 'bg-teal' : s.tone === 'mint' ? 'bg-mint' : 'bg-paper/35',
								]}
								style={`width:${s.pct}%`}
							/>
						</div>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</div>
	<p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-paper/45">
		Reținut de platformă, eliberat la confirmare. Nu e escrow: escrow are o definiție
		legală pe care Stripe nu o oferă.
	</p>
</figure>
